<title>ARGENTINA: TABLE - ARGENTINA'S TABACAL H1 NET LOSS $10.3 MLN.</title>
<headline>TABLE - ARGENTINA'S TABACAL H1 NET LOSS $10.3 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30. Net loss $10.3 million vs n/a.</p>
<p>NOTE: Sugar company San Martin del Tabacal SA said first half results were after a $314,000 extraordinary loss. It provided no other information on its earnings.</p>
<p>The company reported a net worth of $101 million and negative retained earnings of $64.85 million.</p>
<p>((-Guillermo Haskel, Buenos Aires newsroom, 541 318-0650))</p>
